{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40545","headline":"怀素台歌 · 裴说","name":"怀素台歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我呼古人名，鬼神侧耳听。\n杜甫李白与怀素，文星酒星草书星。\n永州东郭有奇怪，笔冢墨池遗迹在。\n笔冢低低高如山，墨池浅浅深如海。\n我来恨不已，争得青天化爲一张纸。\n高声唤起怀素书，搦管研朱点湘水。\n欲归家，重叹嗟。\n眼前有三个字，枯树槎，乌梢蛇，墨老鵶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}